      "description": "{\"type\": \"array\", \"items\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"segment_id\": \"stable identity\", \"output_interval\": \"half-open integer rational ticks\", \"contributions\": {\"type\": \"array\", \"items\": {\"required\": [\"source_ref\", \"mapping_curve\", \"role\"], \"properties\": {\"source_ref\": \"typed reference to actual media version or declared generated layer\", \"source_interval\": \"ordered bounds [low_tick,high_tick); reverse direction is in mapping_curve\", \"mapping_curve\": \"source-time function of output-time; hold may be constant\", \"weight_curve\": \"effective contribution over output interval, including alpha/gain\", \"role\": \"visual/audio/mask/control; control is not content contribution\", \"precision\": \"exact/approximate/unknown\"}}}, \"map_kind\": {\"enum\": [\"identity\", \"cut\", \"forward_linear\", \"reverse\", \"hold\", \"piecewise_speed\", \"transition\", \"mix\", \"insert\"]}, \"curve\": \"piecewise invertible segments or explicit ambiguity\", \"endpoint_policy\": \"half-open ownership and rounding only at renderer\", \"mapping_quality\": \"exact/approximate/unknown\", \"provenance\": \"actual transform or manual evidence\"}, \"rules\": [\"一个输出点可有多个贡献源，权重随时间变化；透明或静音权重可为零\", \"定格输出多个时刻指向一个源点，源到输出反查返回区间而非伪一一映射\", \"倒放与速度坡道使用明确方向及分段单调区间；求逆返回所有可能输出区间\", \"插入独立素材按其真实来源映射，纯生成图层无原视频时间\", \"拼接半开边界恰属一段；浮点显示值不参与账本关联\", \"倒放源区间边界仍low<high，方向由映射函数表示；不可把start>end当合法半开区间\", \"定格用固定source_tick和非空输出区间表达，不伪造零长可播放源片段\", \"源时间反查只返回实际被使用的输出区间集合；未被消费的源段可以没有输出\", \"改变方向的速度坡道拆为单调区段并处理零速度点，禁止用未声明不可逆标量除法\"], \"required\": [\"segment_id\", \"output_interval\", \"contributions\", \"map_kind\", \"mapping_quality\"]}, \"authority\": \"唯一持久化时间贡献段；旧kind与单input_ref格式在入口显式迁移后使用\"}",
